<title>USA: Chris-Craft sets three pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Chris-Craft sets three pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chris-Craft Industries Inc said Tuesday its board has declared a three percent stock dividend on common stock and a three percent stock dividend on class B common stock.</p>
<p>The dividends are payable in common stock and class B common stock, respectively, on April 2 to stockholders of record on March 20.</p>
<p>The conversion rate of Chris-Craft's $1.40 cumulative convertrible preferred stock will be appropriately adjusted, the company said.</p>
</text>
